# Internal / competition materials — never publish to the public repo
docs/

# Research bundle archives. v5 is committed as immutable provenance (its
# SHA-256 is recorded in RESEARCH_MANIFEST.md); v4 and earlier are obsolete
# and deliberately excluded so no one integrates from the wrong one.
rbf-research-bundle-v4.zip

# Native verification artifacts (SSD-local; never the internal disk)
.venv/
.cache/
NATIVE_VERIFICATION.md

# Private handoff notes. Untracked by intent, ignored so that intent survives a
# `git add -A`. This repo has a PUBLIC remote, so "nobody has staged it yet" is
# not a control -- it is an absence of accidents.
#
# The file carries no credentials (verified by scan), but it does carry internal
# working notes: open defects, undiagnosed failures, and surfaces flagged as
# unaudited. Useful to whoever is working on this; misleading out of context.
HANDOFF.md
